post.description:
Scopes: `webhooks.all` (optional) or `webhooks.create`
The Location header contains the API location of the newly created entity (WIP).
While validating the supplied URL, a POST request with the following payload (prettified for clarity) will be sent
`{
  "data": {
    "event": "webhook.validation",
    "timestamp": "2017-07-27T21:46:00.0800000Z"
  }
}`

